 "teaches": [
  "style card puts picture and text in one surface card; aspect 0.75 gives 4:3 pictures at every column count (2 on a phone, 3 at 640x360, 4 at 800x1280, 6 at 1280x800)",
  "Without art each card gets a generated CoverArt in its own colour and symbol (rice_bowl, local_pizza, bakery_dining), turned by its index; badge puts Vegan or New on the picture's corner",
  "meta is the short bold value at the caption's end (the time); section starts Weekend baking on a new row",
  "onClick runs after selected is set: hostNamedAction openRecipe sends the tapped card's index. The name is in every card, which json2rc declares once on purpose (see java_difference)"
 ],
